WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:35.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:35.800 --> 00:37.120
Song Yi.

3
00:37.760 --> 00:39.320
- Hm? - How much farther?

4
00:41.480 --> 00:42.160
What's wrong?

5
00:42.320 --> 00:43.560
Tired?

6
00:45.040 --> 00:46.040
I'm not tired

7
00:46.200 --> 00:47.960
but the way I am now

8
00:48.120 --> 00:50.440
I can't see any of it, however beautiful.

9
00:51.120 --> 00:52.800
Didn't you want to paint the sunrise?

10
00:52.846 --> 00:54.485
A sunrise is painted from life.

11
00:54.680 --> 00:56.400
Would you have me paint it blind?

12
00:56.680 --> 00:58.000
Besides

13
00:58.600 --> 01:00.440
look at what time it is.

14
01:00.720 --> 01:02.000
There's no sunrise to catch.

15
01:03.720 --> 01:04.720
Heh.

16
01:05.100 --> 01:06.500
We did miss the sunrise

17
01:06.840 --> 01:08.399
but you can paint the sunset.

18
01:08.400 --> 01:09.599
Or if all else fails

19
01:09.600 --> 01:10.720
just paint the scenery.

20
01:11.880 --> 01:13.720
So you really are making me paint blind.

21
01:14.000 --> 01:15.000
Come on.

22
01:15.240 --> 01:16.640
It's not painting blind...

23
01:19.280 --> 01:20.560
it's painting with your heart.

24
01:22.520 --> 01:23.520
Painting with…

25
01:24.720 --> 01:25.840
with my heart?

26
01:28.520 --> 01:29.760
You'll see in a bit.

27
01:31.000 --> 01:32.000
Mm.

28
01:39.160 --> 01:40.160
Song Yi.

29
01:40.579 --> 01:41.579
There yet?

30
01:42.940 --> 01:43.940
Yeah.

31
01:44.560 --> 01:45.560
We're here.

32
01:49.519 --> 01:51.039
The wind's really strong here.

33
01:53.365 --> 01:54.365
Here.

34
01:54.566 --> 01:55.566
Come here to me.

35
02:12.406 --> 02:13.446
Give me your hand.

36
02:16.126 --> 02:16.966
Let me

37
02:16.967 --> 02:18.126
help you paint.

38
02:19.566 --> 02:20.566
Mm.

39
02:23.726 --> 02:24.726
In the distance

40
02:25.246 --> 02:27.366
there's a long range of mountains.

41
02:28.566 --> 02:30.046
At the foot of the mountains

42
02:30.886 --> 02:32.246
there's a village.

43
02:34.166 --> 02:35.646
And through the village

44
02:36.006 --> 02:37.886
a winding river flows.

45
02:42.006 --> 02:43.726
And this patch on the left

46
02:44.566 --> 02:46.806
is a grove of snow-covered cedars.

47
02:48.966 --> 02:51.366
Even in this season, there's still snow.

48
02:53.046 --> 02:54.646
The altitude's high here.

49
03:05.359 --> 03:06.159
And here.

50
03:07.232 --> 03:08.792
Imagine a sunset.

51
03:13.636 --> 03:16.126
The sunset is stained red

52
03:17.303 --> 03:18.782
just like

53
03:18.783 --> 03:20.743
a perfectly ripe cherry tomato.

54
03:22.856 --> 03:24.776
Nobody describes a sunset like that.

55
03:27.989 --> 03:29.789
Because I love to eat, that's why.

56
03:37.863 --> 03:38.863
Look over here.

57
03:39.703 --> 03:42.383
Ridge after ridge of mountains

58
03:43.103 --> 03:44.782
and the sunlight

59
03:44.783 --> 03:48.609
paints them layer by layer in lines of gold.

60
03:51.983 --> 03:52.983
It's beautiful.

61
04:07.903 --> 04:08.943
What's this?

62
04:09.983 --> 04:12.023
Um... the sunset?

63
04:13.383 --> 04:14.383
Correct.

64
04:23.783 --> 04:25.783
What did you draw left of the sun?

65
04:27.503 --> 04:28.743
I drew you.

66
04:31.943 --> 04:33.183
Then...

67
04:34.583 --> 04:35.583
Then...

68
04:43.903 --> 04:45.582
then this one on the right

69
04:45.583 --> 04:46.703
has to be you.

70
05:54.409 --> 05:55.529
Goodbye, Xu Feiyu.

71
05:56.449 --> 05:58.129
I accepted your mother's request

72
05:59.143 --> 06:01.183
to leave me in a world you can't see.

73
06:02.623 --> 06:03.703
Perhaps she was right,

74
06:04.783 --> 06:07.863
perhaps time will prove everything.

75
06:54.063 --> 06:55.342
Don't be nervous

76
06:55.343 --> 06:56.663
don't rush it,

77
06:57.543 --> 07:00.263
open your eyes slowly.

78
07:22.383 --> 07:23.742
How does it feel?

79
07:23.743 --> 07:24.743
Son.

80
07:25.303 --> 07:26.903
Is everything in focus?

81
07:28.743 --> 07:29.743
Yes

82
07:30.063 --> 07:31.063
I can see clearly.

83
07:31.064 --> 07:32.102
Oh

84
07:32.103 --> 07:33.103
that's wonderful.

85
07:33.104 --> 07:34.622
Thank you, Doctor!

86
07:34.623 --> 07:35.623
You're welcome.

87
07:35.624 --> 07:37.103
Once you're outside

88
07:37.343 --> 07:39.182
try to keep his eyes

89
07:39.183 --> 07:40.622
on things far away.

90
07:40.623 --> 07:43.383
It'll help him adjust.

91
07:43.583 --> 07:44.583
All right.

92
07:45.503 --> 07:46.942
Take this medicine home

93
07:46.943 --> 07:48.303
have him take it on time.

94
07:49.503 --> 07:50.743
Get well soon.

95
07:51.343 --> 07:52.263
Okay.

96
07:52.263 --> 07:53.263
Thank you, Doctor.

97
07:56.399 --> 07:59.339
[Doctors are kindhearted, love without borders]

98
09:06.783 --> 09:07.223
Honestly

99
09:07.543 --> 09:08.543
you two

100
09:08.783 --> 09:10.423
had me worried sick.

101
09:11.783 --> 09:13.383
Everything's fine, isn't it?

102
09:15.663 --> 09:17.662
How did you convince Xu Yun

103
09:17.663 --> 09:20.143
to let you see Feiyu after the bandages came off?

104
09:21.503 --> 09:23.182
With the thing she does best.

105
09:23.183 --> 09:24.183
What?

106
09:26.463 --> 09:27.463
"A deal."

107
09:27.983 --> 09:29.063
Oh.

108
09:30.063 --> 09:32.583
No wonder she told me you two had settled it.

109
09:33.503 --> 09:36.022
But the terms of that deal are a little too...

110
09:36.023 --> 09:37.142
A little too cold?

111
09:37.143 --> 09:37.783
Exactly.

112
09:37.903 --> 09:39.542
She even made you switch numbers,

113
09:39.543 --> 09:40.543
wiped every contact,

114
09:40.544 --> 09:42.143
erased every trace.

115
09:42.663 --> 09:43.663
Cold.

116
09:45.703 --> 09:47.223
She really is ruthless.

117
09:47.783 --> 09:49.143
As cold as ten years ago.

118
09:51.903 --> 09:53.903
Why do you have to go this far?

119
09:56.943 --> 09:58.943
Xu Feiyu and I made a promise.

120
10:00.543 --> 10:02.143
On the day the bandages came off

121
10:02.863 --> 10:04.303
he'd see what I look like.

122
10:05.663 --> 10:07.103
Doing it this way today

123
10:08.303 --> 10:10.382
keeps the promise I made to him

124
10:10.383 --> 10:11.502
without breaking

125
10:11.503 --> 10:13.183
my deal with Auntie Xu.

126
10:18.383 --> 10:21.143
Can you… really forget Feiyu?

127
10:26.943 --> 10:27.943
I don't know.

128
10:29.103 --> 10:30.543
Looks like...

129
10:30.983 --> 10:32.303
I don't get a choice either.

130
10:59.143 --> 11:00.863
Give him back the puzzle and this.

131
11:01.663 --> 11:02.663
I'm quitting smoking.

132
11:05.383 --> 11:06.863
Nothing to remember him by?

133
11:08.983 --> 11:09.983
Nothing.

134
11:34.983 --> 11:35.983
Don't move.

135
11:39.743 --> 11:40.743
Mom.

136
11:40.783 --> 11:42.582
What are you doing?

137
11:42.583 --> 11:42.863
Shh.

138
11:43.223 --> 11:44.223
Quiet.

139
11:50.183 --> 11:52.342
Isn't this a bit much?

140
11:52.343 --> 11:53.783
Better safe than sorry.

141
11:54.783 --> 11:56.422
All the bad luck you had

142
11:56.423 --> 11:57.383
while you were sick

143
11:57.383 --> 11:58.303
burn it all

144
11:58.303 --> 11:59.303
toss it behind you!

145
11:59.583 --> 12:00.662
Now do as I say.

146
12:00.663 --> 12:01.183
Step over.

147
12:01.463 --> 12:02.463
Fine.

148
12:05.743 --> 12:06.823
Happy now?

149
12:08.183 --> 12:09.783
Go put on some new clothes.

150
12:22.783 --> 12:23.783
Ah.

151
12:32.983 --> 12:35.103
Sorry, the number you dialed does not exist,

152
12:36.063 --> 12:37.743
Please check it and redial.

153
12:38.583 --> 12:41.703
Sorry, the number you dialed does not exist.

154
12:42.143 --> 12:43.823
Please check it and redial.

155
12:50.623 --> 12:52.743
Sorry, the number you dialed does not exist,

156
12:53.743 --> 12:55.423
Please check it and redial.

157
12:56.263 --> 12:57.263
Sorry.

158
13:01.663 --> 13:02.823
How do you feel?

159
13:03.143 --> 13:04.343
Feeling better?

160
13:05.143 --> 13:06.143
Yeah

161
13:06.263 --> 13:06.903
I'm fine now

162
13:07.183 --> 13:08.943
I'm calling Song Yi.

163
13:14.863 --> 13:16.543
He said

164
13:17.743 --> 13:19.863
to give you this before he left.

165
13:33.263 --> 13:34.423
Song Yi's?

166
13:38.783 --> 13:40.543
He said he's quit smoking.

167
13:42.583 --> 13:44.463
Then why did he change his number too?

168
13:45.583 --> 13:47.303
That I don't know.

169
13:49.183 --> 13:51.702
He got that number here

170
13:51.703 --> 13:53.502
and he's back in Singapore

171
13:53.503 --> 13:54.702
so of course it doesn't work.

172
13:54.703 --> 13:55.983
It's not normal!

173
13:56.263 --> 13:57.383
What's his new number?

174
13:58.263 --> 13:59.743
Why didn't he tell me?

175
14:02.543 --> 14:03.943
That's…

176
14:07.263 --> 14:08.663
Did he tell you?

177
14:11.263 --> 14:12.383
No.

178
14:16.983 --> 14:18.343
Any other way to reach him?

179
14:23.463 --> 14:25.463
Right… there's WeChat!

180
14:30.383 --> 14:31.903
I never added him on WeChat.

181
14:33.183 --> 14:34.183
What about yours?

182
14:34.383 --> 14:35.063
Let me see!

183
14:35.064 --> 14:37.022
I… I don't have it either.

184
14:37.023 --> 14:38.303
Show me!

185
14:38.583 --> 14:39.783
See for yourself.

186
15:06.703 --> 15:07.703
He…

187
15:09.223 --> 15:11.503
I don't know what he looks like.

188
15:13.903 --> 15:15.743
No way to contact him.

189
15:18.303 --> 15:20.383
All I know is he came from Singapore.

190
15:27.183 --> 15:29.383
Is he someone who doesn't exist?

191
15:32.583 --> 15:33.583
No.

192
15:37.463 --> 15:38.463
That's not right.

193
15:39.263 --> 15:41.383
Didn't you used to work at his house?

194
15:45.343 --> 15:48.543
That was back when I was in college.

195
15:49.183 --> 15:50.742
That was years ago.

196
15:50.743 --> 15:52.663
That street's probably gone by now.

197
15:54.303 --> 15:55.703
No way to reach him at all?

198
15:58.463 --> 15:59.543
No.

199
16:10.863 --> 16:12.863
Then he planned this from the start
